  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"f31b1f66-9cee-419c-b2b0-87d9b9b2e3a9\">\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"/images/articles/f31b1f66-9cee-419c-b2b0-87d9b9b2e3a9-1.jpg\" alt=\"A lone bare tree in a snowy field\">\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"poem\">\n  <p>'Tis winter now; the fallen snow<br>\n  has left the heavens all coldly clear;<br>\n  through leafless boughs, the sharp winds blow,<br>\n  and all the earth lies dead and drear.</p>\n\n  <p>And yet God's love is not withdrawn;<br>\n  his life within the keen air breathes;<br>\n  his beauty paints the crimson dawn,<br>\n  and clothes each branch with glittering wreaths.</p>\n\n  <p>And though abroad the sharp winds blow,<br>\n  and skies are chill, and frosts are keen,<br>\n  home closer draws her circle now,<br>\n  and warmer glows her light within.</p>\n\n  <p>O God, you give the winter's cold,<br>\n  as well as summer's joyous rays,<br>\n  you warmly in your love enfold,<br>\n  and keep us through life's wintry days.</p>\n</div>\n</article>\n",
